isted (Sunset Beach Resort, Eternal Moments Photography, Gourmet Celebrations) and saved checklist (1 saved Ceremony Planning) remained available.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Date validation not enforcing future-date-only constraint\", \"actual\": \"System accepted and saved wedding date of Jan 1, 2025 (a past date), violating the requirement that only future dates should be accepted. Previous future date (Sep 20, 2027) was replaced instead of being retained.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Venues page displays complete details for each venue inline including: name (Rosewood Garden Estate), location (Napa Valley, CA), type (Garden), price range (Luxury $$$), rating (4.9), capacity (Up to 200 guests), and descriptive summary. View Details button is available for each venue. Vendors page similarly displays complete vendor information inline.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Successfully marked first task in Ceremony Planning checklist as completed. Checklist progress updated immediately from 0% to 20%. Dashboard progress updated to 20% and checklist preview updated to \\\"1 of 5 completed\\\". After page reload, progress persisted at 20% and checklist preview still showed \\\"1 of 5 completed\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Verified immediate results updates without separate submit action: Clicking Ballroom filter immediately updated count from \\\"Showing 8 of 8\\\" to \\\"Showing 1 of 8\\\". Clicking Clear all filters immediately restored count to \\\"Showing 8 of 8\\\". No separate submit button required; updates are instant.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Form retains cancelled draft values instead of showing last saved values\", \"actual\": \"After cancelling changes (budget 100000 → discard, guests 300 → discard), the dashboard correctly retained saved values ($60,000, 180 guests). However, reopening the editor showed the cancelled draft values (100000 budget, 300 guests) instead of the last saved values (60000 budget, 180 guests).\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Dashboard displays: couple names (Alice Johnson & Charlie Thompson), formatted date (Sep 20, 2027), budget ($60,000), guest count (180), progress (20%), favorite counts (1 saved venues, 2 saved vendors, 1 saved checklist), saved checklist preview (Ceremony Planning, 1 of 5 completed), and favorite venue/vendor previews (Sunset Beach Resort, Eternal Moments Photography, Gourmet Celebrations).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Venues listing displays: name (Rosewood Garden Estate), location (Napa Valley, CA), type (Garden), price range (Luxury $$$), rating (4.9), summary/description, and capacity (Up to 200 guests). Vendors listing displays: name (Eternal Moments Photography), service type (Photography), price range (Luxury $$$), rating (4.9), and summary. All required fields present for both.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Verified checklist collection covers all 5 required categories with at least one checklist per category: Planning (12+ Months Before, 8-10 Months Before), Ceremony (Ceremony Planning), Reception (Reception Details), Attire (Wedding Attire), Honeymoon (Honeymoon Planning). Each task includes title and explanatory description (e.g., Reception Details: \\\"Create seating chart - Thoughtfully arrange guests to encourage mingling\\\").\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Verified combined search and filter criteria: Search \\\"beach\\\" returned 2 results.